land that my ancestors were forced to leave behind.
我的祖先被迫离开的那片土地。

1574
01:05:07.840 --> 01:05:11.200
I highly recommend listening to the whole song.
我强烈推荐大家去听听整首歌。

1575
01:05:11.580 --> 01:05:15.120
Do you know who chose that song for Andy to start singing?
你们知道是谁选了这首歌让安迪唱的吗？

1576
01:05:15.400 --> 01:05:17.220
Was it Ed or one of the writers?
是艾德还是编剧组选的？

1577
01:05:17.680 --> 01:05:19.640
Well, Rose, that was scripted.
嗯，罗斯，那是剧本里写好的。

1578
01:05:20.220 --> 01:05:24.180
And I did take your advice, and I went and listened to the whole song, and I have a little
我确实听取了你的建议，去听了整首歌，我这里有一小段

1579
01:05:24.180 --> 01:05:26.980
audio clip for us, because it is really, truly beautiful.
音频片段放给大家听，因为它真的非常、非常优美。

1580
01:05:27.140 --> 01:05:29.440
You thought you weren't going to hear more music today, but you are.
你们以为今天听不到更多音乐了，但你们会听到的。

1581
01:05:29.560 --> 01:05:30.740
This is our music episode.
这是我们的音乐特辑。

1582
01:05:30.980 --> 01:05:34.340
I am so excited because, Rose, I have been to Loch Lomond.
我太兴奋了，因为罗斯，我去过罗蒙湖。

1583
01:05:34.660 --> 01:05:34.920
Hey!
嘿！

1584
01:05:34.920 --> 01:05:37.300
I have stayed at Loch Lomond.
我在罗蒙湖住过。

1585
01:05:37.440 --> 01:05:39.160
I've been on a boat on Loch Lomond.
我坐船游览过罗蒙湖。

1586
01:05:39.160 --> 01:05:40.120
It's beautiful.
那里很美。

1587
01:05:40.140 --> 01:05:41.380
I want to hear the song.
我想听听这首歌。

1588
01:05:41.380 --> 01:06:02.190
By yon, Bonnie Bates, and by yon, Bonnie Brace, where the sun shines bright on Loch Lomond, my true love will never meet.
在那美丽的河岸，在那美丽的河岸，阳光照耀在罗蒙湖上，我的真爱永不相见。

1589
01:06:05.580 --> 01:06:17.080
Bonnie Bates of Loch Lomond, who take the high road, and I'll take the low.
罗蒙湖的美丽河岸，你走高路，我走低路。

1590
01:06:20.720 --> 01:06:30.050
In Scotland afar, my true love will never meet.
在遥远的苏格兰，我的真爱永不相见。

1591
01:06:32.450 --> 01:06:37.170
The Bonnie Bates of Loch Lomond.
罗蒙湖的美丽河岸。

1592
01:06:40.380 --> 01:06:41.400
Isn't that beautiful?
这不是很美吗？

1593
01:06:41.620 --> 01:06:42.360
It is beautiful.
确实很美。

1594
01:06:42.580 --> 01:06:43.720
That was Peter Hollins.
那是彼得·霍林斯唱的。

1595
01:06:44.040 --> 01:06:45.340
Well, I loved it.
嗯，我很喜欢。

1596
01:06:45.460 --> 01:06:46.740
And Loch Lomond is gorgeous.
而且罗蒙湖真的很壮丽。

1597
01:06:47.180 --> 01:06:48.560
I will share a picture.
我会分享一张照片。

1598
01:06:48.840 --> 01:06:49.960
In our stories.
在我们的快拍里。

1599
01:06:50.020 --> 01:06:50.260
Yes.
好的。

1600
01:06:50.400 --> 01:06:51.360
That are now highlighted.
现在已经设为精选了。

1601
01:06:51.760 --> 01:06:53.780
Rose, thank you so much for writing in about that.
罗斯，非常感谢你写信来询问这件事。

1602
01:06:54.340 --> 01:06:56.880
Well, the Mean Girls party is about to start.
好吧，《贱女孩》派对马上就要开始了。

1603
01:06:57.480 --> 01:07:00.280
Pam's like, listen, if you're going to be mean, just try to be subtle.
帕姆说，听着，如果你非要刻薄，那就试着含蓄一点。

1604
01:07:00.980 --> 01:07:03.240
Daryl suggests they have a code name for Nellie.
达里尔建议他们给内莉起个代号。

1605
01:07:03.940 --> 01:07:08.880
I have two favorite lines from this episode, and the first one is in this couplet of dialogue.
这一集里我有两句最喜欢的台词，第一句就在这段对话里。

1606
01:07:09.300 --> 01:07:09.460
Okay.
好的。

1607
01:07:09.800 --> 01:07:13.400
Daryl says, in the warehouse, we use code names for people we want to talk about.
达里尔说，在仓库里，我们用代号来称呼想谈论的人。

1608
01:07:14.000 --> 01:07:15.200
Andy was Jelly Roll.
安迪的代号是“果酱卷”。

1609
01:07:15.420 --> 01:07:16.620
Mike was Dennis the Menace.
迈克的代号是“捣蛋鬼丹尼斯”。

1610
01:07:16.760 --> 01:07:17.800
Ryan was Douchebag.
瑞安的代号是“混蛋”。

1611
01:07:18.140 --> 01:07:20.740
Ryan says, hey, that's not a code name.
瑞安说，嘿，那不是代号。

1612
01:07:20.740 --> 01:07:21.800
That's just an insult.
那纯粹是人身攻击。

1613
01:07:22.000 --> 01:07:23.420
And here's my favorite line.
这就是我最喜欢的那句台词。

1614
01:07:23.540 --> 01:07:26.080
Oscar says, plus everyone would know who you meant.
奥斯卡说，而且大家都会知道你说的是谁。

1615
01:07:26.820 --> 01:07:28.120
And then Ryan goes, yeah.
然后瑞安说，没错。

1616
01:07:28.720 --> 01:07:29.600
I know.
我知道。

1617
01:07:29.820 --> 01:07:30.840
He made me laugh.
他把我逗笑了。

1618
01:07:30.920 --> 01:07:31.940
It was so perfect.
真是太绝了。

1619
01:07:32.240 --> 01:07:34.280
The code name Pam pitches is Mondays.
帕姆提议的代号是“周一”。

1620
01:07:34.440 --> 01:07:36.640
Everyone is annoyed with Mondays, right?
大家都讨厌周一，对吧？

1621
01:07:36.960 --> 01:07:42.760
Ryan, who I think still really doesn't like Pam, says, no, let's use the code name Pam.
瑞安，我觉得他依然很不喜欢帕姆，他说，不，我们用“帕姆”作为代号吧。

1622
01:07:43.320 --> 01:07:44.600
And everyone agrees.
大家都同意了。

1623
01:07:44.920 --> 01:07:48.440
I don't know if you noticed, but at 13 minutes and 37 seconds,
不知道你有没有注意到，在13分37秒的时候，

1624
01:07:48.440 --> 01:07:51.440
the top of Angela's ponytail is a mess.
安吉拉马尾辫的顶部乱糟糟的。

1625
01:07:52.020 --> 01:07:53.560
There's hairs going everywhere.
头发到处乱翘。

1626
01:07:54.140 --> 01:07:58.680
That's because in the shooting draft, there was a scene where Meredith comes into the break room
那是因为在拍摄初稿中，有一场戏是梅雷迪思走进休息室，

1627
01:07:58.680 --> 01:08:01.220
and is delighted by what she sees.
对她所看到的景象感到非常高兴。

1628
01:08:01.380 --> 01:08:04.260
She turns to Angela and says, the break room?
她转向安吉拉说，休息室？

1629
01:08:04.420 --> 01:08:06.100
What kind of crap party is this?
这是什么烂派对啊？

1630
01:08:06.420 --> 01:08:08.880
Angela smiles mischievously at Meredith.
安吉拉调皮地对着梅雷迪思笑了笑。

1631
01:08:09.300 --> 01:08:12.740
Meredith puts her in a headlock, says, ooh, was this you, kiddo?
梅雷迪思锁住她的头说，噢，是你干的吗，小鬼？

1632
01:08:12.860 --> 01:08:13.900
And gives her a noogie.
然后给了她一个脑瓜崩。

1633
01:08:14.300 --> 01:08:14.740
Oh!
噢！

1634
01:08:14.740 --> 01:08:19.100
And then Angela shoves Meredith away, and that's why her hair's a mess.
接着安吉拉推开了梅雷迪思，所以她的头发才乱了。

1635
01:08:19.540 --> 01:08:20.300
Very interesting.
非常有意思。

1636
01:08:21.200 --> 01:08:26.660
Well, Nellie's going to arrive, and they're going to start with Creed serenading her.
好吧，内莉要到了，他们会以克里德为她献唱作为开场。

1637
01:08:27.540 --> 01:08:28.860
He says, get comfy.
他说，坐舒服点。

1638
01:08:28.980 --> 01:08:31.040
This first song is over 30 minutes long.
这第一首歌有30多分钟长。

1639
01:08:31.600 --> 01:08:32.940
Oh, my gosh, lady.
天哪，女士。

1640
01:08:33.160 --> 01:08:34.580
I remember us cracking up.
我记得我们当时笑得前仰后合。

1641
01:08:34.640 --> 01:08:34.960
I know.
我知道。

1642
01:08:35.140 --> 01:08:38.940
There was a candy bag alt for this, and it's so funny.
这里原本有一个关于糖果袋的备选方案，非常搞笑。

1643
01:08:39.580 --> 01:08:42.680
Creed would have, instead of saying the song is 30 minutes long,
克里德本可以不说这首歌有30分钟长，

1644
01:08:42.680 --> 01:08:46.220
he would have said, the first song is audience participation.
而是说，第一首歌需要观众参与。

1645
01:08:46.460 --> 01:08:51.060
When I say go, you all start moaning like you're dying or something.
当我喊开始时，你们所有人都要像快死了一样呻吟。

1646
01:08:51.940 --> 01:08:52.580
Wow.
哇。

1647
01:08:52.960 --> 01:08:53.740
Can you imagine?
你能想象吗？

1648
01:08:54.240 --> 01:08:57.400
I have a fun fact about the guitar that Creed is playing.
关于克里德弹的那把吉他，我有一个趣闻。

1649
01:08:57.740 --> 01:08:59.180
Is it his actual guitar?
那是他自己的吉他吗？

1650
01:08:59.320 --> 01:09:00.360
It's his personal guitar.
那是他私人的吉他。

1651
01:09:00.360 --> 01:09:05.920
It's a limited edition replica of Robert Johnson's 1926 Gibson L1.
这是罗伯特·约翰逊1926年款吉布森L1吉他的限量版复刻品。

1652
01:09:06.340 --> 01:09:09.460
Robert Johnson was an American blues musician and songwriter.
罗伯特·约翰逊是一位美国蓝调音乐家和词曲作者。

1653
01:09:09.460 --> 01:09:16.040
If you go to Creed's house, he has a wall of guitars and mandolins and a banjo,
如果你去克里德家，他有一整面墙的吉他、曼陀林和班卓琴，

1654
01:09:16.040 --> 01:09:21.400
and the man, like Ed, he can just pick up anything with strings pretty much and play it.
而且那个人，就像埃德一样，他几乎随手拿起任何带弦的乐器都能弹奏。

1655
01:09:21.620 --> 01:09:21.760
Yeah.
没错。

1656
01:09:22.340 --> 01:09:27.500
We're going back to the cabin again now, and Aaron tells Andy, I think we should leave.
我们现在又回到了小屋，亚伦告诉安迪，我觉得我们应该离开。

1657
01:09:28.780 --> 01:09:31.420
But Andy says, I'm going to get this breakup over with.
但安迪说，我要把这次分手了结掉。

1658
01:09:31.540 --> 01:09:32.920
He pulls Jessica aside.
他把杰西卡拉到一边。

1659
01:09:32.920 --> 01:09:38.280
Finally, he's babbling, and she says, wait a second, are you dumping me?
最后，他语无伦次，杰西卡说，等一下，你是要甩了我吗？

1660
01:09:38.580 --> 01:09:40.640
Are you dumping me for Aaron?
你是为了亚伦要甩了我吗？

1661
01:09:41.140 --> 01:09:45.460
You said she wasn't relationship material, and she wasn't as good as me.
你说过她不是谈恋爱的料，而且她没我好。

1662
01:09:45.820 --> 01:09:46.180
Jessica.
杰西卡。

1663
01:09:46.660 --> 01:09:47.100
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1664
01:09:47.660 --> 01:09:49.320
This is not you, Jessica.
这不像你，杰西卡。

1665
01:09:49.640 --> 01:09:51.860
Jessica, you're doing a low blow here, lady.
杰西卡，你这招太卑鄙了，女士。

1666
01:09:52.120 --> 01:09:52.760
Not cool.
真不地道。

1667
01:09:53.100 --> 01:09:53.440
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1668
01:09:53.660 --> 01:09:55.000
I had a turn here.
刚才轮到我说了。

1669
01:09:55.540 --> 01:09:56.300
Not cool.
真不地道。

1670
01:09:56.560 --> 01:10:00.620
What Andy and Aaron are doing is not cool, but that was not cool.
安迪和亚伦的做法确实不地道，但你刚才那话也不地道。

1671
01:10:00.620 --> 01:10:03.880
But at the same time, she's pissed off, lady.
但与此同时，她确实被气坏了，女士。

1672
01:10:04.280 --> 01:10:05.480
Who knows what you would have said?
谁知道你会说出什么话来？

1673
01:10:05.940 --> 01:10:06.100
True.
也是。

1674
01:10:06.520 --> 01:10:08.120
You might have, like, listen.
你可能会，比如，听着。

1675
01:10:08.320 --> 01:10:09.280
I'm not Jessica.
我不是杰西卡。

1676
01:10:09.600 --> 01:10:09.800
I know.
我知道。

1677
01:10:09.800 --> 01:10:11.620
I'm saying Jessica is better than this comment.
我是说杰西卡本不该说出这种话。

1678
01:10:11.780 --> 01:10:13.680
We have put Jessica on a pedestal.
我们一直把杰西卡捧得太高了。

1679
01:10:13.920 --> 01:10:19.500
But I do think lots of us, maybe in that moment, would have been like, are you f***ing kidding
但我确实觉得我们很多人，在那一刻，可能会说，你现在是在跟我开什么

1680
01:10:19.500 --> 01:10:20.260
me right now?
国际玩笑吗？

1681
01:10:20.640 --> 01:10:21.000
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1682
01:10:21.220 --> 01:10:21.560
Yeah.
没错。

1683
01:10:21.560 --> 01:10:25.600
I think that would have been better than these low blows to Aaron in this moment.
我觉得那样说会比现在这样攻击亚伦要好得多。

1684
01:10:26.120 --> 01:10:27.260
Andy starts to panic.
安迪开始慌了。

1685
01:10:27.440 --> 01:10:28.040
He's like, whoa, whoa, whoa.
他就像是，哇，哇，哇。

1686
01:10:28.120 --> 01:10:28.460
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

1687
01:10:28.520 --> 01:10:28.880
Wait, wait.
等等，等等。

1688
01:10:29.040 --> 01:10:29.220
Okay.
好吧。

1689
01:10:30.940 --> 01:10:32.260
Super honesty time.
超级坦白时间。

1690
01:10:32.660 --> 01:10:33.400
I'm gay.
我是同性恋。

1691
01:10:33.980 --> 01:10:34.560
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1692
01:10:35.140 --> 01:10:36.300
And Jessica's like, what?
杰西卡一脸震惊，什么？

1693
01:10:36.780 --> 01:10:37.220
Yeah.
没错。

1694
01:10:37.500 --> 01:10:40.520
Her gay friend, Kenny, claims to have known this all along.
她的同性恋朋友肯尼声称他早就知道了。

1695
01:10:40.680 --> 01:10:42.560
He's like, I knew it.
他说，我就知道。

1696
01:10:42.980 --> 01:10:44.480
Jessica says, Andy, you're not gay.
杰西卡说，安迪，你不是同性恋。

1697
01:10:44.620 --> 01:10:47.180
I mean, when we were together, you seemed pretty excitable.
我的意思是，我们在一起的时候，你看起来挺兴奋的。

1698
01:10:47.660 --> 01:10:49.100
Andy's like, well, I was faking it.
安迪说，好吧，我是装出来的。

1699
01:10:49.180 --> 01:10:50.540
I had to fake it every time.
我每次都得装出来。

1700
01:10:51.060 --> 01:10:51.380
Yeah.
没错。

1701
01:10:51.460 --> 01:10:54.020
He imagined he was in a steam room with John Stamos.
他想象自己正和约翰·斯塔莫斯待在蒸汽房里。

1702
01:10:54.480 --> 01:10:57.940
Jessica then says, I can't say it doesn't make sense.
杰西卡随后说，我不能说这没道理。

1703
01:10:58.660 --> 01:11:00.360
And then she says, look, you know what, Andy?
然后她说，听着，你知道吗，安迪？

1704
01:11:00.460 --> 01:11:00.920
It's fine.
没关系。

1705
01:11:01.100 --> 01:11:03.020
I didn't think we were going to get married or anything.
我没想过我们要结婚什么的。

1706
01:11:03.020 --> 01:11:05.500
I'm just upset for now.
我只是现在有点难过。

1707
01:11:06.680 --> 01:11:07.960
There's the Jessica we know.
这才是我们认识的杰西卡。

1708
01:11:08.060 --> 01:11:08.860
There's the Jessica we know.
这才是我们认识的杰西卡。

1709
01:11:09.320 --> 01:11:13.700
I want to give a shout out to Kenny, who was played by Greg Worswick.
我要特别感谢肯尼，他由格雷格·沃斯威克饰演。

1710
01:11:14.040 --> 01:11:17.260
He was a main company member at the Groundlings in Los Angeles.
他是洛杉矶“接地气”剧团的正式成员。

1711
01:11:17.260 --> 01:11:25.620
He's been in Bridesmaids, Curb Your Enthusiasm, Superstore, Parks and Rec, and Crossover Connection with you and Brett Gelman, Fresh Off the Boat.
他出演过《伴娘》、《抑制热情》、《爆笑超市》、《公园与游憩》，还有和你以及布雷特·格尔曼合作的《交叉连接》，以及《初来乍到》。

1712
01:11:25.780 --> 01:11:26.100
Hey.
嘿。

1713
01:11:26.940 --> 01:11:29.220
Is Fresh Off the Boat our new Crossover Connection?
《初来乍到》是我们新的《交叉连接》吗？

1714
01:11:29.300 --> 01:11:29.640
Maybe.
也许吧。

1715
01:11:30.040 --> 01:11:30.780
Sorry, Monk.
抱歉，蒙克。

1716
01:11:31.240 --> 01:11:31.840
Might be.
可能是。

1717
01:11:32.460 --> 01:11:36.340
Well, Andy and Erin are now really awkwardly going to leave the cabin.
好吧，安迪和艾琳现在要非常尴尬地离开小屋了。

1718
01:11:36.520 --> 01:11:39.760
You can tell Erin, you know, those comments stung.
你可以看出艾琳，你知道的，那些评论刺痛了她。

1719
01:11:39.980 --> 01:11:40.300
Yeah.
是啊。

1720
01:11:40.380 --> 01:11:42.520
And now she's wondering what all Andy said about her.
现在她想知道安迪到底说了她些什么。

1721
01:11:43.060 --> 01:11:45.980
She's going to kind of just start to shut down.
她开始有点封闭自己了。

1722
01:11:45.980 --> 01:11:46.400
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1723
01:11:46.680 --> 01:11:47.820
She's going to take a nap.
她打算小睡一会儿。

1724
01:11:48.100 --> 01:11:51.160
Well, she saw a lot of turkeys, and it made her tired.
好吧，她看到了很多火鸡，这让她感到疲惫。

1725
01:11:51.640 --> 01:11:51.880
Yeah.
是啊。

1726
01:11:52.520 --> 01:11:53.980
Andy's picking up on these cues.
安迪察觉到了这些信号。

1727
01:11:54.260 --> 01:12:01.420
He really didn't handle that well, and now he hasn't set himself up to succeed with Erin, and he wants to do right by it.
他处理得确实不好，现在他没能为和艾琳的未来打好基础，但他想弥补这一切。

1728
01:12:01.600 --> 01:12:02.020
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1729
01:12:02.540 --> 01:12:04.880
At least right by Erin, not so much right by Jessica.
至少是对艾琳弥补，对杰西卡就没那么上心了。

1730
01:12:04.880 --> 01:12:06.380
So he turns back around.
所以他转过身。

1731
01:12:06.660 --> 01:12:11.600
He goes back to the cabin, and he wants to tell Jessica the truth, and here it is.
他回到小屋，想告诉杰西卡真相，就是这样。

1732
01:12:11.980 --> 01:12:13.080
He's in love with Erin.
他爱上了艾琳。

1733
01:12:13.080 --> 01:12:15.140
Erin, she's totally relationship material.
艾琳，她绝对是理想的伴侣人选。

1734
01:12:15.640 --> 01:12:17.080
Erin is so happy.
艾琳太开心了。

1735
01:12:17.260 --> 01:12:17.960
She is beaming.
她笑逐颜开。

1736
01:12:18.440 --> 01:12:24.460
Jessica and her friends literally yell and chase them to the car, throwing, it looks like wedding cake at them.
杰西卡和她的朋友们真的大喊大叫着追向他们的车，看起来像是朝他们扔了婚礼蛋糕。

1737
01:12:24.880 --> 01:12:28.920
And they peel out and drive away, and they're so happy.
他们猛踩油门开车离开，他们太幸福了。

1738
01:12:29.460 --> 01:12:29.640
Yeah.
是啊。

1739
01:12:29.840 --> 01:12:30.960
And they finally kiss.
他们终于接吻了。

1740
01:12:31.140 --> 01:12:31.360
Yeah.
是啊。

1741
01:12:31.780 --> 01:12:31.960
Yeah.
是啊。

1742
01:12:32.340 --> 01:12:34.900
Jessica's friends are going to talk about Andy for a long time.
杰西卡的朋友们会谈论安迪很长一段时间。

1743
01:12:35.380 --> 01:12:35.780
Yeah.
是啊。

1744
01:12:35.780 --> 01:12:42.440
I feel like on her gummy penis weekend bachelorette party, there's going to be a big balloon labeled Andy.
我觉得在她那场充满软糖阴茎的单身派对上，会有一个写着“安迪”的大气球。

1745
01:12:42.620 --> 01:12:43.880
There sure is.
肯定会有。

1746
01:12:44.420 --> 01:12:48.940
Up next is maybe one of my favorite scenes we filmed for this whole time.
接下来可能是我在这段时间里拍摄的最喜欢的场景之一。

1747
01:12:48.940 --> 01:12:52.220
Susan, I mean, we laughed so hard.
苏珊，我是说，我们当时笑得太厉害了。

1748
01:12:52.360 --> 01:12:53.700
Okay, so here's what's going on.
好了，情况是这样的。

1749
01:12:53.840 --> 01:13:03.100
We're back in the Mean Girls in the Break Room party, and everyone is giving a toast, but the toasts are really mean-spirited towards Pam, quote-unquote Pam.
我们回到了“休息室里的贱女孩”派对，每个人都在敬酒，但这些祝酒词对帕姆——所谓的“帕姆”——非常刻薄。

1750
01:13:03.400 --> 01:13:06.540
And it ends with everyone chanting, we hate Pam.
最后大家齐声高喊：我们讨厌帕姆。

1751
01:13:06.700 --> 01:13:07.100
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1752
01:13:07.560 --> 01:13:10.320
And that's when our magician enters.
就在那时，我们的魔术师登场了。

1753
01:13:10.760 --> 01:13:11.020
Yeah.
是啊。

1754
01:13:11.580 --> 01:13:13.520
He offers to make Pam disappear.
他提议让帕姆消失。

1755
01:13:13.740 --> 01:13:14.040
Poof.
砰。

1756
01:13:14.620 --> 01:13:15.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1757
01:13:15.460 --> 01:13:17.340
Where do we even start with this scene?
我们该从哪儿开始说这一幕呢？

1758
01:13:17.560 --> 01:13:18.320
I don't know.
我不知道。

1759
01:13:18.660 --> 01:13:23.320
John Krasinski had to stand right next to Brett Gelman, and this was a mistake.
约翰·卡拉辛斯基不得不站在布雷特·格尔曼旁边，这真是个错误。

1760
01:13:23.440 --> 01:13:23.820
Mistake.
错误。

1761
01:13:23.880 --> 01:13:26.080
This was a noodle moment for John.
这对约翰来说是个“面条时刻”。

1762
01:13:26.080 --> 01:13:26.720
Full noodle.
完全软成面条了。

1763
01:13:26.960 --> 01:13:28.980
He couldn't even stand.
他甚至站都站不稳。

1764
01:13:29.520 --> 01:13:34.160
I scoured the season eight bloopers, hoping that they would be in there, and they are not.
我搜遍了第八季的NG花絮，希望能找到这一段，但并没有。

1765
01:13:34.160 --> 01:13:35.220
They are somewhere.
它们肯定在某处。

1766
01:13:35.740 --> 01:13:37.380
Dave Rogers has got to have them.
戴夫·罗杰斯肯定有这些素材。

1767
01:13:37.480 --> 01:13:37.780
Ugh.
呃。

1768
01:13:37.780 --> 01:13:41.420
I was so thankful that I was off camera.
我很庆幸当时我不在镜头里。

1769
01:13:42.620 --> 01:13:49.640
I will—first of all, wait, before we get ahead of ourselves, did you know in the shooting draft this character's name was called Magic Mark?
我会——首先，等等，在我们继续之前，你知道在拍摄剧本里这个角色的名字叫“魔术马克”吗？

1770
01:13:49.880 --> 01:13:50.620
I didn't.
我不知道。

1771
01:13:50.820 --> 01:13:51.160
Okay.
好吧。

1772
01:13:52.100 --> 01:13:57.600
So the scene was extended, and he would have had this introduction moment where he came in the room.
所以这一幕原本更长，他本该有一个走进房间的自我介绍环节。

1773
01:13:57.860 --> 01:13:59.120
It read like this.
剧本上是这么写的。

1774
01:13:59.480 --> 01:14:02.000
Okay, everyone, so my name is Magic Mark.
好了，各位，我叫魔术马克。

1775
01:14:02.080 --> 01:14:04.560
I used to be a Magic Marker.
我以前是个马克笔（Magic Marker）。

1776
01:14:04.560 --> 01:14:16.580
And then he holds up a Magic Marker, and then he says, but then I got rid of—he produces a DVD of ER and says, the ER, magic!
然后他举起一支马克笔，接着说，但我摆脱了——他拿出一张《急诊室的故事》（ER）的DVD说，急诊室（ER），魔术！

1777
01:14:16.580 --> 01:14:17.900
And he made it disappear.
然后他让它消失了。

1778
01:14:18.300 --> 01:14:18.600
Oh.
噢。

1779
01:14:19.480 --> 01:14:24.200
And it says that Jim clocks Nellie, who has a very tight smile.
剧本上写着吉姆注意到了奈莉，她露出了一个非常僵硬的微笑。

1780
01:14:24.640 --> 01:14:26.520
She's not a fan of Magic Mark.
她可不是魔术马克的粉丝。

1781
01:14:27.020 --> 01:14:32.120
Here's the amazing thing about this, which is that we did not hire a magician.
最神奇的地方在于，我们并没有聘请真正的魔术师。

1782
01:14:32.120 --> 01:14:32.820
Mm-mm.
嗯嗯。

1783
01:14:32.980 --> 01:14:43.640
Instead, Brett Gilman had to kind of learn some of this sleight of hand on the fly, like the little exploding fire thing in the hand.
相反，布雷特·格尔曼不得不临时学一些戏法，比如手里那个会爆炸的小火苗。

1784
01:14:44.240 --> 01:14:46.540
Steve Burgess says that's actually a really easy one.
史蒂夫·伯吉斯说那其实很简单。

1785
01:14:46.560 --> 01:14:50.980
But when you see him in the episode when he brings the dove—
但当你在剧集中看到他变出鸽子的时候——

1786
01:14:50.980 --> 01:14:51.700
The bird.
那只鸟。

1787
01:14:51.700 --> 01:14:54.900
It was so awkward and clumsy every time.
每次都显得那么尴尬和笨拙。

1788
01:14:55.120 --> 01:14:55.380
It was so clunky.
太生硬了。

1789
01:14:55.380 --> 01:14:56.320
It was never good.
从来没成功过。

1790
01:14:56.460 --> 01:14:58.600
And we couldn't get through that moment.
我们根本拍不完那一幕。

1791
01:14:58.660 --> 01:14:59.360
Look what I wrote.
看看我写了什么。

1792
01:14:59.520 --> 01:14:59.680
What?
什么？

1793
01:14:59.680 --> 01:15:01.500
We could not get through this moment.
我们根本拍不完那一幕。

1794
01:15:01.560 --> 01:15:01.860
No.
没错。

1795
01:15:02.060 --> 01:15:03.740
Every time that bird appeared.
每次那只鸟一出现。

1796
01:15:03.940 --> 01:15:05.120
It was so ridiculous.
简直太荒谬了。

1797
01:15:05.800 --> 01:15:08.140
And it was so close to John, too.
而且离约翰也太近了。

1798
01:15:08.380 --> 01:15:09.220
Oh, my God.
天哪。

1799
01:15:09.640 --> 01:15:09.960
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1800
01:15:10.700 --> 01:15:22.440
Well, Magic Mark is going to ask Nellie if she would like to be his special volunteer for the day, but Jim is going to step in, and he's going to start sabotaging the act.
好吧，魔术马克打算问奈莉愿不愿意当他今天的特别志愿者，但吉姆会插手，并开始破坏他的表演。

1801
01:15:22.920 --> 01:15:23.100
Yeah.
是啊。

1802
01:15:23.580 --> 01:15:27.300
And then Pam is also going to get in on this sabotage.
然后帕姆也参与了这次破坏行动。

1803
01:15:27.480 --> 01:15:35.040
My second favorite line of the whole episode is when Robert turns to Dwight and says, why is Jim treating the magician poorly?
整集里我第二喜欢的台词是罗伯特转向德怀特说，吉姆为什么要那样对待魔术师？

1804
01:15:35.420 --> 01:15:35.740
Yeah.
没错。

1805
01:15:35.740 --> 01:15:40.640
There's also a moment when Brett, as the magician, looks at Jim and goes, what the hell, man?
还有一个瞬间是布雷特作为魔术师看着吉姆说，你到底搞什么鬼，伙计？

1806
01:15:40.820 --> 01:15:42.400
I put on a clean show.
我的表演很干净。

1807
01:15:42.940 --> 01:15:47.600
This was the second thing that we couldn't get through because it's just this, like, burst of anger.
这是我们第二个没法顺利拍下去的片段，因为那简直就是一阵愤怒的爆发。

1808
01:15:47.700 --> 01:15:49.780
He's been holding it together the whole time.
他一直都在强忍着。

1809
01:15:50.080 --> 01:15:52.960
We also lost it when he singled out Phyllis.
当他专门点名菲利斯时，我们也笑场了。

1810
01:15:53.060 --> 01:15:53.160
Yes.
是的。

1811
01:15:53.200 --> 01:15:54.920
When he said, all right, where's Phyllis?
当他说，好吧，菲利斯在哪儿？

1812
01:15:55.120 --> 01:15:55.900
Who's Phyllis?
谁是菲利斯？

1813
01:15:55.980 --> 01:15:57.720
Look, this is really uncool, okay?
听着，这真的很不厚道，好吗？

1814
01:15:58.260 --> 01:15:59.940
You can see Phyllis laughing.
你能看到菲利斯在笑。

1815
01:15:59.940 --> 01:16:00.900
You can see her laughing.
你能看到她在笑。

1816
01:16:01.420 --> 01:16:01.860
Yeah.
是啊。

1817
01:16:02.180 --> 01:16:04.120
And then Dwight says, scram, wizard.
然后德怀特说，滚开，巫师。

1818
01:16:04.120 --> 01:16:07.900
And then they argue all the way out the door, down the hallway.
接着他们一路吵着出了门，一直吵到走廊里。

1819
01:16:08.140 --> 01:16:09.460
That was not scripted.
那不是剧本里写的。

1820
01:16:10.000 --> 01:16:10.780
Oh, amazing.
哦，太棒了。

1821
01:16:11.000 --> 01:16:13.240
They were just, he was just supposed to get him out of the room.
他本来只需要把他赶出房间就行了。

1822
01:16:13.360 --> 01:16:17.500
But the two of them, I don't know if you remember, Jenna, kept yelling at each other as they left.
但他们两个，珍娜，我不确定你还记不记得，他们离开时一直在互相大喊大叫。

1823
01:16:17.680 --> 01:16:18.600
It was so good.
那太精彩了。

1824
01:16:18.720 --> 01:16:19.260
So good.
太精彩了。

1825
01:16:19.880 --> 01:16:24.200
Sometimes I think about what days would I go back and reshoot.
有时我会想，如果能回到过去，我会重拍哪一天的戏。

1826
01:16:24.200 --> 01:16:25.400
I would go back to this day.
我会回到这一天。

1827
01:16:25.680 --> 01:16:26.540
I would as well.
我也是。

1828
01:16:26.720 --> 01:16:30.080
I also think about characters I wish had come back.
我也会想念那些我希望回归的角色。

1829
01:16:30.360 --> 01:16:32.640
And I would have loved to have seen more of Magic Mark.
我真的很想多看看魔术师马克。

1830
01:16:32.800 --> 01:16:36.720
Like, maybe he really pisses Dwight off because they're in the same Dungeons and Dragons group.
比如，也许他真的惹恼了德怀特，因为他们是在同一个《龙与地下城》小组里的。

1831
01:16:36.780 --> 01:16:37.560
I don't know.
我不知道。

1832
01:16:37.880 --> 01:16:38.080
Yeah.
是啊。

1833
01:16:38.380 --> 01:16:42.000
The way Dwight said scram, wizard, you kind of felt like they had history.
德怀特说“滚开，巫师”的方式，让你觉得他们之间好像有什么过节。

1834
01:16:42.000 --> 01:16:47.880
You know, Nellie is really touched by this magician sabotage.
你知道，奈莉真的被这次魔术师破坏行动感动了。

1835
01:16:48.080 --> 01:16:49.820
She gives a very touching speech.
她发表了一段非常感人的演讲。

1836
01:16:50.060 --> 01:16:53.520
She thinks everybody is a brilliant employee in their own way.
她认为每个人都有自己独特的才华。

1837
01:16:54.140 --> 01:16:55.160
Robert agrees.
罗伯特表示赞同。

1838
01:16:55.320 --> 01:16:56.980
He says, great party.
他说，很棒的派对。

1839
01:16:57.600 --> 01:17:02.560
This party is maybe one of the most successful PPC parties.
这个派对可能是派对策划委员会最成功的一次派对。

1840
01:17:03.160 --> 01:17:05.320
And they tried to make it the worSt.
而他们本想把它搞砸。

1841
01:17:05.520 --> 01:17:06.860
What does that say about this group?
这说明了这个团队的什么特质呢？

1842
01:17:07.200 --> 01:17:10.520
How is this one of the best PPC parties?
为什么这会是派对策划委员会最棒的派对之一？

1843
01:17:10.520 --> 01:17:16.220
Well, usually when they throw a party for someone, the person does not enjoy their birthday or their day.
嗯，通常当他们为某人举办派对时，那个人并不会享受自己的生日或纪念日。

1844
01:17:16.400 --> 01:17:20.060
They usually are like, this is the worst party I've ever been to.
他们通常会说，这是我参加过最烂的派对。

1845
01:17:20.180 --> 01:17:21.380
Nellie loved her party.
奈莉很喜欢她的派对。

1846
01:17:21.600 --> 01:17:21.960
Okay.
好吧。

1847
01:17:21.960 --> 01:17:23.980
So by that, I guess it was a success.
所以照这么说，我想它成功了。

1848
01:17:24.320 --> 01:17:27.180
Also, I just want to say, I like a carrot cake.
另外，我只想说，我喜欢胡萝卜蛋糕。

1849
01:17:27.620 --> 01:17:31.140
And I would not be disappointed to eat a carrot cake at a party.
如果能在派对上吃到胡萝卜蛋糕，我不会感到失望的。

1850
01:17:31.360 --> 01:17:35.260
Do you know how much butter and cream cheese is in a carrot cake?
你知道胡萝卜蛋糕里放了多少黄油和奶油奶酪吗？

1851
01:17:35.420 --> 01:17:35.960
So much.
太多了。

1852
01:17:35.960 --> 01:17:36.560
So much.
太多了。

1853
01:17:36.720 --> 01:17:38.280
It can't help but be delicious.
它肯定很好吃。

1854
01:17:38.680 --> 01:17:39.240
I love it.
我超爱。

1855
01:17:39.240 --> 01:17:42.240
A red velvet cake that everybody always covets and loves.
一款人人都垂涎、人人都爱的红丝绒蛋糕。

1856
01:17:42.300 --> 01:17:44.360
It's really a cousin to the carrot cake.
它其实算是胡萝卜蛋糕的亲戚。

1857
01:17:44.920 --> 01:17:45.940
Sort of similar.
有点像。

1858
01:17:46.380 --> 01:17:46.920
So maybe.
也许吧。

1859
01:17:47.200 --> 01:17:49.080
Listen, get your penis mold.
听着，拿出你的阴茎模具。

1860
01:17:49.420 --> 01:17:50.980
Put some carrot cake in it.
往里填点胡萝卜蛋糕。

1861
01:17:51.540 --> 01:17:52.560
It's a great cake.
这蛋糕很棒。

1862
01:17:52.800 --> 01:17:53.700
It's a great party cake.
这是一款很棒的派对蛋糕。

1863
01:17:53.820 --> 01:17:54.520
It sure is.
确实如此。

1864
01:17:54.720 --> 01:17:57.260
Well, this episode is going to end with some Hank sass.
好了，这集节目要以汉克的毒舌收尾了。

1865
01:17:57.720 --> 01:17:59.500
Pam and Jim are leaving for the day.
帕姆和吉姆正准备下班离开。

1866
01:17:59.700 --> 01:18:05.100
And Pam goes up to Hank and says, I thought I was very specific about you not letting up a magician.
帕姆走到汉克面前说：我记得我特别交代过，不准放魔术师进来。

1867
01:18:05.800 --> 01:18:08.200
Hank said, I have my eyes open.
汉克说：我一直盯着呢。

1868
01:18:08.200 --> 01:18:10.240
And Jim's like, actually, he made it up there.
吉姆就说：其实，他还是进去了。

1869
01:18:10.660 --> 01:18:12.100
Pam's like, yeah, he came and went.
帕姆说：是啊，他来去自如。

1870
01:18:12.380 --> 01:18:17.860
And then Hank has this great passive-aggressive sass moment where he's like, wait a minute.
然后汉克就展现了他那种绝妙的阴阳怪气，他说：等等。

1871
01:18:18.400 --> 01:18:20.760
You said it was a magician, right?
你刚才说那是魔术师，对吧？

1872
01:18:21.300 --> 01:18:23.060
You don't think he could have used.
你难道不觉得他可能用了……

1873
01:18:23.260 --> 01:18:24.360
It couldn't have been.
不可能是……

1874
01:18:24.500 --> 01:18:25.200
And Pam's like, you know what?
帕姆说：算了，你知道吗？

1875
01:18:25.220 --> 01:18:25.840
Let's just go.
我们走吧。

1876
01:18:26.080 --> 01:18:26.460
Let's go.
走吧。

1877
01:18:27.400 --> 01:18:28.360
Hank sass.
汉克的毒舌。

1878
01:18:28.580 --> 01:18:29.340
Hank sass.
汉克的毒舌。

1879
